[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0882","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0882.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0730","title":"惠普 HP-UX 权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 操作系统中 newgrp 命令存在权限验证不足漏洞。攻击者可利用此漏洞在本地执行 newgrp 命令，绕过权限验证机制，成功提升用户权限至系统管理员级别。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 11.0 版本，攻击者无需任何身份验证即可利用，攻击复杂度较低。可通过修改系统配置文件或执行特定命令触发，导致系统保密性、完整性和可用性受到部分破坏。微软已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞，建议用户及时更新操作系统补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0730"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:21Z","remediation":"建议立即安装惠普发布的安全补丁 PHSS_19411（对应安全公告 HPSBUX0008-118），或升级至 HP-UX 11.0 后续修补版本。若无法立即打补丁，可通过移除 newgrp 命令的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/newgrp）或限制本地用户登录权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0144.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1580","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0730.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0730.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0730","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0730.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0730.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ef5f7d15f762d5df7a3a2d2246dcee2b17ebeef4/2000/CVE-2000-0730.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0730.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0a07da1560249b2b9027d6c5d908418017bb7740/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0730.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0730.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0730.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0882.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0881","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0881.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0729","title":"FreeBSD FreeBSD 3.x/4.x/5.x ELF 映像头畸形本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 3.x、4.x 和 5.x 版本存在本地拒绝服务漏洞，源于内核对 ELF 可执行文件镜像头部解析时缺乏完整性校验。本地攻击者可通过构造畸形 ELF 文件头（如损坏的段头表、程序头表或异常字段值）并执行该程序，触发内核在加载 ELF 二进制时的解析异常，导致内核崩溃或拒绝服务。攻击条件为攻击者需拥有本地系统账户并能执行自定义二进制文件，利用方式为编译或手工构造畸形 ELF 可执行文件并直接运行。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 3.x 至 5.x 全系列版本，CVSS 评分 2.1（本地访问/低复杂度/无需认证/部分可用性影响），属于本地拒绝服务漏洞，FreeBSD 官方已在后续版本中修复该漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0729"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:21Z","remediation":"升级到 FreeBSD 4.1.1-STABLE 或更高版本（4.x 分支），或 5.0-CURRENT 2000 年 8 月 9 日之后的最新快照。如无法立即升级，可应用 FreeBSD-SA-00:00.elf 安全公告中发布的补丁重建内核，补丁文件可从 FreeBSD 官方档案获取。作为临时缓解措施，应避免以 root 或普通用户身份执行来源不明的 ELF 格式二进制文件，直至完成系统升级。FreeBSD 3.x 和更早版本已停止官方支持，建议迁移至受支持的稳定版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-08/0337.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1534","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1625","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5967","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0729.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0729","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0729.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ef5f7d15f762d5df7a3a2d2246dcee2b17ebeef4/2000/CVE-2000-0729.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0729.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c7