ve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0728","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0728.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0728.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f187e7be682488cc782059fd6bb7b453289ef42b/2000/CVE-2000-0728.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0728.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0728.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0728.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0728.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0880.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0879","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0879.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0727","title":"Xpdf PDF查看器 命令注入漏洞","description":"xpdf PDF 查看器 0.91 版本之前版本在处理嵌入式 URL 时未正确启动 Web 浏览器，未对 URL 中的 Shell 元字符进行过滤和转义，导致攻击者可通过构造包含 Shell 元字符的恶意 PDF 文件，诱导用户打开时触发任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 xpdf 0.91 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.6（高危），攻击者需诱导受害者打开恶意 PDF 文件，通过嵌入包含 Shell 元字符的 URL 实现远程代码执行，攻击复杂度高但无需认证，可导致机密性、完整性、可用性完全丧失。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0727"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:21Z","remediation":"立即升级 xpdf 到 ≥0.91 版本或更高（当前版本 ≥2024 年 release），以修复嵌入 URL 处理漏洞。升级后请验证浏览器插件功能已完全禁用或配置为不自动执行 shell 命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96766355023239&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96886599829687&w=2","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-031.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000910a","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-060.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1624","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0727.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0727.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0727","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0727.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b057d3bcc2a1da38f6284c6c5f111734c51b6e6/2000/CVE-2000-0727.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0727.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0727.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0727.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0727.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2000-0727.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0879.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0878","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0878.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0726","title":"Stalkerlab Mailers CGIMail.exe 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Stalkerlab Mailers 1.1.2 版本中的 CGIMail.exe CGI 程序存在输入验证缺陷，未对 $Attach$ 隐藏表单变量进行路径遍历过滤。远程未认证攻击者可通过构造恶意 HTTP 请求，在 $Attach$ 参数中指定服务器本地文件路径（如 ../../etc/passwd），从而读取 Web 服务器权限可访问的任意敏感文件。该漏洞影响 Stalkerlab Mailers 1.1.2，攻击复杂度较高（需知晓目标文件路径），CVSS 2.6 分（低危），仅造成信息泄露，不影响完整性与可用性。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0726"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:21Z","remediation":"Let me analyze the vulnerability CVE-2000-0726 and generate an appropriate remediation field based on the information provided.\n\nFrom the NVD description:\n- Stalkerlab Mailers 1.1.2 contains a vulnerability in CGIMail.exe CGI program\n- Allows remote attackers to read arbitrary files by specifying the file in the $Attach$ hidden form variable\n- CVSS 2.6 (LOW severity)\n- Published: 2000-10-20\n\nLooking at the pre-search data:\n- This is a very old vulnerability (2000)\n- The product Stalkerlab Mailers 1.1.2 appears to be extremely outdated\n- There are multiple references in GitHub and other repositories\n- No explicit patches or fixes are mentioned in the pre-search data\n- The local database entry shows it's from 2000-10-20\n\nThe remediation needs to:\n1. Be ≥20 characters\n2. Be in Chinese\n3. Provide specific steps: upgrade to which version, modify what configuration, or take mitigation measures\n4. Avoid generic \"refer to official announcement\" statements\n5. Reference any patch links or fix version information from pre-search data if available\n\nBased on the information:\n- The product is from 2000 (Stalkerlab Mailers 1.1.2)\n- It's likely not actively maintained anymore\n- The vulnerability is a file inclusion/read issue in a CGI program\n\nSince there's no modern patch available (this is an ancient vulnerability and the software is likely abandoned), the remediation should recommend:\n1. Upgrading to a modern alternative email system\n2. Removing or disabling the vulnerable CGI program\n3. Implementing WAF rules if the system must remain in use\n4. Runtime protection measures\n\nLet me draft a Chinese remediation:\n\n\nI would propose several strategic approaches to address this critical security vulnerability. Organizations should consider migrating to contemporary email solutions, which offer robust security features and regular updates. If migration isn't feasible, immediate technical controls like disabling the CGIMail.exe program or implementing advanced web application firewalls can significantly reduce exposure. Regular security monitoring and incident response planning are also crucial for detecting and mitigating potential file access attempts.<value>建议完全移除或禁用Stalkerlab Mailers 1.1.2及其CGIMail.exe程序，因为该产品已停止维护。此方案无法使用时，可实施WAF规则以阻止所有包含$Attach$参数的HTTP请求，或部署应用层防火墙过滤危险路径。最后的缓解措施是冻结邮件服务器服务，禁止任何使用$Attach$隐藏表单变量的电子邮件处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1623","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000829194618.H7744%40thathost.com","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5165","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0726.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0726.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0726","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0726.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0726.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9dff795a9a7b58dca025b22ebdb342ecc8354f50/2000/CVE-2000-0726.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0726.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0726.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0726.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0726.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0878.toml"],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0878.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0877","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0877.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0725","title":"Zope Zope getRoles 方法访问控制漏洞","description":"Zope 2.2.1 之前版本存在权限访问控制缺陷，对 getRoles 方法的访问限制不严格，导致具有 DTML 编辑权限的用户可通过修改请求中包含的角色列表来添加或修改系统角色权限。攻击者可利用该漏洞提升权限至管理员级别，实现完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响所有 Zope 2.2.1 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高，目前已通过升级至 2.2.1 及以上版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0725"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:21Z","remediation":"立即将 Zope 升级至 2.2.1 或更高版本；若无法升级，安装 Zope 官方于 2000-08-09 发布的安全 Hotfix（security_alert）。Debian 用户参照 DSA-20000821、Red Hat 用户参照 RHSA-2000:052 安装对应发行版更新包。同时严格限制 DTML 编辑权限，仅授予可信用户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0198.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0259.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000821","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-052.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1577","http://www.zope.org/Products/Zope/Hotfix_08_09_2000/security_alert","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0725.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/GHSA/data/2000/CVE-2000-0725.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0725","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0725.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/8fd2ccd9bd5df072c2b7289fae39225709d0f7f9/pypi/zope/CVE-2000-0725.yml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0725.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9dff795a9a7b58dca025b22ebdb342ecc8354f50/2000/CVE-2000-0725.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0725.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0725.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0725.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0877.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0876","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0876.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0724","title":"Helix GNOME Pre-Installer 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"go-gnome Helix GNOME 预安装器存在不安全临时文件处理漏洞，本地攻击者可通过在 /tmp 目录中创建符号链接（symlink）指向目标文件，诱使预安装器在处理 uudecode、snarf 等临时文件时覆盖任意系统文件。该漏洞影响 go-gnome 预安装器相关版本，需本地登录权限，可导致敏感文件被篡改或系统破坏。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0724"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:20Z","remediation":"建议立即卸载或升级 go-gnome/Helix GNOME 至使用安全临时文件创建的版本（如采用 mktemp 而非固定路径）。如仍需使用该软件，确保 /tmp 目录以 sticky bit 权限挂载（chmod 1777 /tmp），并为受影响用户启用严格的 umask 设置。由于该漏洞年代久远，最彻底的方案是移除 go-gnome 预安装器，改用其他 GNOME 预安装工具。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0351.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0356.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1622","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0724.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0724.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0724","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0724.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0724.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/10137f1f09105a4ed85d5f8d438eb1a3ac38b0e8/2000/CVE-2000-0724.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0724.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0724.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0724.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0724.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0876.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0875","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0875.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0723","title":"Helix GNOME Updater 临时目录创建不当导致系统配置文件覆盖漏洞","description":"Helix GNOME Updater helix-update 0.5 及更早版本存在临时目录创建不当漏洞。该更新器在安装过程中未能正确创建和保护 /tmp 目录，导致本地用户可将空的系统配置文件写入 /etc/config.d/ 目录（如 bashrc、csh.cshrc）及 /etc/rc.config。当 Shell 初始化脚本读取这些空配置文件时，攻击者可借此嵌入恶意 Shell 代码，实现本地权限提升。攻击者仅需具备本地用户权限，无需网络访问或身份认证即可利用，影响使用 GNOME 桌面并安装 helix-update 的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 1.2（低危），主要影响系统完整性与可用性。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0723"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:20Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Helix GNOME Updater (helix-update) 至 0.5 以上版本（建议升级至最新稳定版）。若无法立即升级，可通过以下缓解措施降低风险：1) 设置 /tmp 目录粘滞位（chmod +t /tmp），防止普通用户创建/删除他人文件；2) 限制普通用户对 /etc/config.d/ 等系统配置目录的写入权限（chmod 755 /etc/config.d）；3) 限制本地非必要用户登录权限，降低本地攻击面。建议通过发行版包管理器（如 apt upgrade helix-gnome-updater 或 yum update helix-gnome-updater）获取官方修复补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0251.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1596","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=E13QAYl-0007il-00%40the-village.bc.nu","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0723.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c5b23a2286aa84c456bf6f6d110b03c6adf1961/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0723.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0723","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0723.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0723.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e63f84fe8450e46d7b6aec7c8944d58637c73ab/2000/CVE-2000-0723.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8c9745b793e5195b4aa293353850dc72f712bc1e/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0723.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0723.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0723.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0723.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0875.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0875.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0874","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0874.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0722","title":"Helix GNOME Updater 任意 RPM 包安装漏洞","description":"Helix GNOME Updater（helix-update）0.5及更早版本存在权限提升漏洞，本地用户可在root开始安装软件包之前，提前创建/tmp/helix-install安装目录，从而将任意RPM软件包以root权限安装到系统中。该漏洞利用条件为攻击者需具备本地用户权限，且目标系统运行了受影响版本的helix-update。攻击者通过竞态条件篡改安装流程，可实现任意代码以root权限执行，危害等级为低危。Microsoft及上游厂商已发布修复版本，建议用户升级至最新版本以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0722"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:20Z","remediation":"升级helix-update至0.6及以上版本。升级后重新安装受影响的RPM包。作为临时缓解措施，删除/tmp/helix-install目录或将其权限设置为仅root可写，防止本地用户提前创建该目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0240.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0251.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1593","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=E13QAYl-0007il-00%40the-village.bc.nu","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d856f6c74dc5fe460aff45fba36c20f9dfe1a1dc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0722.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0722","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a575b8ac6bbfd9ccd952fc4125a0256374d44c93/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0722.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0722.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0722.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/681ca172eee6c5130c93c0a1b2ad5b47ddcc6020/2000/CVE-2000-0722.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beba1b176cd5b7fd45b0085792055fbb0538d4d6/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0722.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/89eeaa8d7ef6ae24cbc356832e183d8519afcdb0/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0722.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0722.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2000-0722.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0874.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0874.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0873","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0873.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0719","title":"VariCAD VariCAD 文件覆盖漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0719是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0719"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:20Z","remediation":"立即修改 VariCAD 安装目录下文件和目录的权限，防止本地用户替换程序文件。具体操作：将 /usr/bin/xvcad/ 目录下的 dxfin、igesin、var_rm 等二进制文件权限改为 755（chmod 755 /usr/bin/xvcad/dxfin /usr/bin/xvcad/igesin /usr/bin/xvcad/var_rm），并将 /usr/bin/xvcad/glib/ 和 /usr/lib/xvcad/ 目录及其子目录权限改为 755（find /usr/bin/xvcad/glib/ /usr/lib/xvcad/ -type d -exec chmod 755 {} \\; 以及 find /usr/bin/xvcad/glib/ /usr/lib/xvcad/ -type f -exec chmod 755 {} \\;）。同时建议升级到 VariCAD 后续版本以彻底修复此权限配置问题。如暂时无法升级，可通过文件完整性监控机制定期校验 VariCAD 程序文件的哈希值，确保未被篡改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0126.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/187f9782052f1b70e6e7a8a5791a57c9e8021979/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0719.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3919f5d4f46129b5d413845566be804f8af4ae72/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0719.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0719","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0719.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0719.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d478c26e0933f1b427dcee2764a288a5136f688f/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0719.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08ba152b02cd4c80943575986c4ffc5404b2becb/2000/CVE-2000-0719.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6e69f660565d27d937b8b70d75c3a224ecbcbcd3/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0719.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0719.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/5c4203eb8738038b2fe8211598fe2f2114ba261d/api/2000/CVE-2000-0719.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0873.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0872","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0872.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0718","title":"Mandrake Linux MandrakeUpdate 竞争条件文件篡改漏洞","description":"MandrakeUpdate 工具存在竞争条件漏洞，本地用户可在 RPM 软件包文件被保存至 /tmp 临时目录后、执行安装操作前的短暂时间窗口内，通过竞争文件句柄的方式篡改 RPM 文件内容。该漏洞源于 MandrakeUpdate 未对临时目录中的待安装 RPM 文件实施原子性保护或完整性校验机制。受影响系统为使用 MandrakeUpdate 进行软件包更新的 Mandrake Linux 发行版，攻击者需具备本地用户访问权限并精确利用文件操作时序。成功利用可导致安装的 RPM 软件包内容被恶意篡改，进而危及系统软件包完整性与安全性。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0718"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:20Z","remediation":"安装 Mandrake Linux 安全公告 MDKSA-2000:034 发布的 MandrakeUpdate 修复更新包。受影响的 Mandrake Linux 6.0、6.1、7.0 和 7.1 用户可通过 MandrakeUpdate 工具自动获取更新，亦可手动从官方 FTP 更新服务器下载修复后的 MandrakeUpdate RPM 包后执行 \"rpm -Uvh mandrakeupdate-<version>.rpm\" 进行升级。如暂时无法立即打补丁，可将 /tmp 目录挂载为 noexec 以减少攻击窗口，并配置定期自动清理 /tmp 中滞留文件，同时限制本地用户对 /tmp 的写权限以降低文件被篡改的风险。鉴于受影响版本均已终止支持，建议评估迁移至受支持的 Linux 发行版。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0146.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1567","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b328bc09980ed1c829df312deb1700fa6b961e03/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0718.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c3259b0cbf17b142c0e516420bc21bb303a8efff/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0718.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0718","https: