gtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind0008&L=ntbugtraq&F=&S=&P=459","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1553","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5070","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d9173cb87ca4d6d199846d1d27516352b75d2c70/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0716.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ed49b018fbc876ac3a1cc53b206d35c44adb8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0716.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0716","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0716.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0716.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/52ddd3fbe097d381a58d14aae3f8c42a9146b190/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0716.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2000/CVE-2000-0716.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/094d6382e9f2b76e665247588266e58be890fb67/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0716.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0716.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0716.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0870.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0869","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0869.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0715","title":"Red Hat DiskCheck 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.2 的 diskcheck.pl 脚本存在符号链接攻击漏洞，本地用户可通过预测临时文件路径并创建恶意符号链接，诱导脚本以特权写入或覆盖任意系统文件。该漏洞源于脚本创建临时文件时未验证文件是否为符号链接，本地攻击者利用竞争条件将临时文件指向关键系统文件（如 /etc/passwd），导致权限提升或系统文件损坏。影响 Red Hat Linux 6.2 系统，CVSS 2.1 低危（本地攻击、低复杂度、部分完整性影响），攻击者需具备本地账户权限才可利用。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0715"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:19Z","remediation":"建议立即应用 Red Hat 官方安全公告 RHSA-2000:122 发布的补丁，该补丁修复了 Red Hat Powertools 6.2 及 7.0 中 DiskCheck 脚本的符号链接攻击漏洞。可通过 Red Hat 网络自动更新功能获取并安装该安全更新。若无法立即应用补丁，可暂时删除或禁用 /etc/cron.hourly/diskcheck.pl 脚本，或手动修改脚本中的临时文件创建逻辑，使用 mktemp 命令生成随机文件名并设置严格文件权限，避免直接写入固定路径的临时文件。同时应对 /tmp 目录设置粘滞位（chmod +t /tmp），限制普通用户在该目录中创建指向其他文件的符号链接，从而缓解临时文件竞争条件被利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/bugtraq/2000/Aug/0082.html","http://seclists.org/bugtraq/2000/Aug/0096.html","http://seclists.org/bugtraq/2000/Jun/0298.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1552","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0715.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0715.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0715","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0715.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0715.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2000/CVE-2000-0715.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0715.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/094d6382e9f2b76e665247588266e58be890fb67/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0715.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0715.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0715.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0869.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0869.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0868","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0868.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0714","title":"Red Hat Linux umb-scheme 世界可写文件漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux umb-scheme 3.2-11 软件包安装时将文件权限设置为全局可写，导致本地攻击者可修改这些文件并可能提权至完全控制系统。该漏洞影响安装了 umb-scheme 3.2-11 包的 Red Hat Linux 系统，攻击者需具备本地访问权限且无需认证，利用复杂度低，成功利用可导致系统机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失（CVSS 7.2，AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C）。Red Hat 已发布修复补丁修正文件权限配置。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0714"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:19Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 umb-scheme 到 Red Hat 官方修复版本（如 umb-scheme-3.2-12 或更高版本），可通过 Red Hat Network 或官方 FTP 下载更新包安装。若暂无法升级，请立即执行 chmod o-w /usr/lib/umb-scheme/* 移除所有 umb-scheme 目录及文件的全域写权限，或使用 chmod 755 递归修正目录权限，防止本地用户通过写入恶意文件提权。建议同时应用 Red Hat Linux 官方安全公告 RHSA-2000:062 相关补丁包。临时缓解可限制普通用户对 /usr/lib/umb-scheme 目录的写入权限。升级后请验证文件权限为 755/644 且属主为 root:root。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-047.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1551","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0714.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0714.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0714","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0714.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0714.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0714.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/20